  ('10308385','walmart-2024-08-study-v7',array['R4'],'OLD BAY Gluten Free Classic Seafood Seasoning, 6 oz Can','올드베이 클래식 시즈닝 6온스','OLD BAY Gluten Free Classic Seafood Seasoning, 6 oz Can. There are two things you need to know about OLD BAY Seasoning: 1. It’s great on seafood. 2. It’s great on everything else! OLD BAY’s unique blend of 18 herbs and spices was born along the Chesapeake Bay over 75 years ago. Today, it’s won over hearts (and mouths!) across the USA. Marylanders can’t imagine crab without it. They’re shaking and stirring it straight into low country boils down south, and all around the country, folks are getting creative, pairing OLD BAY with pizza, popcorn, donuts, veggies, burgers and fries to name a few. This OLD BAY Classic Seafood Seasoning is in a Plas','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/OLD-BAY-Kosher-Classic-Seafood-Seasoning-6-oz-Can_65a33fb4-d35f-4a1d-9d90-2dda3ccb8a8d.d9c05f29528c682bc64ffc59c4cdf4d7.jpeg','Seasoning mixes & blends',4.43,6000,'fixed-1350-round-100','https://www.walmart.com/ip/OLD-BAY-Kosher-Classic-Seafood-Seasoning-6-oz-Can/10308385',true),
  ('36995775','walmart-2024-08-study-v7',array['R4'],'Dash Original Seasoning Blend, Salt free, 21 oz','대시 오리지널 무염 시즈닝 21온스','Dash Salt-Free Original Seasoning Blend 21 oz bottle helps you make cooking delicious again. This salt free seasoning blend is an all-purpose mix of herbs and spices that is easy to love and simple to pair with almost anything. The flavor of this no salt seasoning blend is created by mixing over 14 different spices together, including cayenne pepper, cumin, basil, and garlic. Dash Salt Free Original Seasoning is kosher so you can enjoy a delicious meal without skipping out on taste. This Dash salt free seasoning is perfect for bringing instant flavor and a little bit of spice to your favorite meats, vegetables, sauces, and more. Smarter cooki','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dash-Original-Seasoning-Blend-Salt-free-21-oz_28115456-d416-4be4-9b81-175844b5cb75.42ebdff81053a3c2f4c3ab0270514de2.jpeg','Seasoning mixes & blends',13.12,17700,'fixed-1350-round-100','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Dash-Original-Seasoning-Blend-Salt-free-21-oz/36995775',true),
  ('864008591','walmart-2024-08-study-v7',array['R4'],'DII 14x72" Modern PVC Polyester Doubleframe Table Runner in Nautical Blue','DII 네이비 블루 14×72인치 테이블 러너','DII offers a full collection of trend-based designs for all seasons. Incorporating the hottest colors and themes, DII brings you a fresh, innovative line of kitchen products, tabletop, gifts, and home decor for every season, every holiday and everyone. DII has a wonderful selection of holiday and everyday table runners available. Our table runners provide a great place to set down platters and to prevent spills and scratches on your tabletop while adding style and flair. Set plants or other centerpieces atop the runner to update any space with a fresh new look. The stylish and simple design will blend in with any decor in your home or kitchen','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/DII-14x72-Modern-PVC-Polyester-Doubleframe-Table-Runner-in-Nautical-Blue_65f5cb0d-6edc-408b-a9d1-4f65224c7eb2_1.3843bf331684a7872addc3cf737cb3bd.jpeg','Table Runners',14.95,20200,'fixed-1350-round-100','https://www.walmart.com/ip/DII-14x72-Modern-PVC-Polyester-Doubleframe-Table-Runner-in-Nautical-Blue/864008591',true)
